ell for search engines, layering in AEO and GEO practices becomes much easier.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113238891\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113238891\",\"name\":\"4. How do I know if my content is showing up in AI answers?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can manually test this by asking tools like ChatGPT, Gemini, and Perplexity questions related to your content and checking if your brand or website gets mentioned. Some newer analytics platforms are also starting to track AI citation data directly.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113255682\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113255682\",\"name\":\"5. Will voice search and AI Overviews reduce my website traffic?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"They can reduce clicks for simple factual queries that get fully answered on the results\u00a0page itself. However, being cited or mentioned in these answers can still build brand awareness and trust, even without a direct click, which is why measuring visibility, not just traffic, matters more now.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113272381\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113272381\",\"name\":\"6. What is the easiest first step to start with GEO?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Start by making your existing content more citation friendly. Add clear statistics with sources, structure your pages with direct answers near the top, and cover topics\u00a0comprehensively,\u00a0so AI models have enough reliable context to quote you accurately.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113286869\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113286869\",\"name\":\"7. Does schema markup actually help with AEO and GEO?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Schema markup helps search engines and AI systems understand exactly what a piece of content is about, which makes it easier for them to pull out the right information for featured snippets, voice answers, and AI generated summaries. It will not guarantee a spot on its own, but it removes a lot of the guesswork for the systems trying to read your page.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113302282\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-vs-aeo-vs-geo\/#faq-question-1784113302282\",\"name\":\"8. Can a small business realistically compete in AEO and GEO?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and often more easily than in traditional SEO. Because AEO and GEO reward clear, well sourced, and genuinely helpful content rather than only domain authority and backlink volume, a smaller website with accurate,\u00a0well structured\u00a0information can still earn snippet wins and AI citations, even while competing against much bigger brands in the traditional rankings.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"SEO vs AEO vs GEO: Key Differences Explained (2026)","description":"SEO vs AEO vs GEO in 2026: Discover the key dif